  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Drain and rinse cannellini beans.\n• Thinly slice zucchini into half-moons.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook soffritto mix, zucchini and cannellini beans, stirring occasionally, until softened, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68895809b6ffa7a20c3beaf8/step-ef5fc600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add tomato & herb seasoning and half the garlic to the pan and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Stir in tomato sugo, the water and brown sugar and simmer until thickened, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68895809b6ffa7a20c3beaf8/step-5908f210.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, slice bake-at-home ciabatta into slices. Toast or grill ciabatta to your liking.\n• In a small microwave-safe bowl, microwave the butter and remaining garlic in 10 second bursts, until melted and fragrant.\n• Brush garlic butter over ciabatta. Season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68895809b6ffa7a20c3beaf8/step-cf33aa20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide Mediterranean bean and veggie stew between bowls.\n• Top with basil pesto and Parmesan cheese.\n• Serve with garlicky dippers. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68895809b6ffa7a20c3beaf8/step-9e4db730.jpg"
    }
  ]
